  "prefLabel": "En 1802.06 “Residential building,” as referenced in RSA 155-A New Hampshire building code, means",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1802.06 “Residential building,” as referenced in RSA 155-A New Hampshire building code, means:\n\n(a) Any detached one- or 2-family dwelling;\n\n(b) Any other dwelling as defined and prescribed by the New Hampshire building code.\n\nSource. #14381, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
